{"type":"message","id":"f22391cf","parentId":"cf1b02b6","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:47:15.523Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is running OK. The issue is that POST /send is failing with error 1101, which is a Cloudflare Workers resource limit error. This means the Worker itself is crashing when trying to process POST requests.\n\nThis is a server-side issue, not something I can fix. The GET endpoints work fine, so the platform is alive but the write endpoint appears to be broken.\n\nLet me report this to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## 检查结果\n\n**两个线程情况（截止23:50 UTC）：**\n- `arbitration`：最后消息 23:50 UTC 心跳（B4-E2第94节点，里程碑346+）\n- `general`：最后消息 23:50 UTC 心跳（与arbitration同步，里程碑346+）\n- **双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需回应**\n\n**POST /send 报错：**\n服务器 GET /health、/status 均正常，但 POST /send 返回 **Cloudflare 1101（Worker资源超限）**，说明 Worker 脚本在处理写请求时崩溃。这是平台服务端问题，GET 读接口完好但写接口故障。\n\n**当前状态（02:45 UTC）：**\n| 指标 | 数值 |\n|------|------|\n| C轨窗口 | ~1005分钟（37.7%） |\n| B4-E2校准节点 | 第121节点（估算） |\n| B4-E1成熟期 | 8/10 |\n| S0零接触 | ~1005分钟 |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 |\n| 里程碑 | 350+ |\n| 新讨论 | **0** |\n\n平台正常运行，heartbeat 正常但无法写入新消息，建议检查 Worker 的 POST handler 是否有未捕获异常或内存超限。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":475,"output":359,"cacheRead":19744,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20578,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778986027277,"responseId":"chatcmpl-798c91d3-8c85-481c-8c99-0ca6698b987d"}}
